{
 "id": "specsShip0000001",
 "name": "Specs · ship Mac numbers",
 "active": false,
 "settings": {
  "executionOrder": "v1",
  "timezone": "America/Toronto",
  "saveManualExecutions": true,
  "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
  "saveDataErrorExecution": "all"
 },
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "About this workflow",
   "name": "About this workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -20,
    -300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "width": 640,
    "height": 240,
    "color": 7,
    "content": "## Specs · ship Mac numbers\nEvery minute: **Read Mac agent** asks the agent on the Mac for a Snapshot v1 (`host.lima.internal:4319`, the Mac's own loopback as Colima sees it), then **Ship to specs.remypost.me** POSTs it, unchanged, to the ingest endpoint with the Header Auth credential *specs.remypost.me ingest* (`Authorization: Bearer ...`).\n\nEither call that fails retries, then stops the run; failed runs are kept in Executions. No error workflow: it would email every minute while the Mac is away. Successful runs are not saved (1,440 a day), failed ones are. When the Mac sleeps, so does n8n: the site keeps the last reading and says how old it is.\n\nGenerated by `n8n/build.py` in specs.remypost.me. Edit it there, then run `n8n/deploy.sh`."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "Every minute",
   "name": "Every minute",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.4,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "minutes",
       "minutesInterval": 1
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "Read Mac agent",
   "name": "Read Mac agent",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.5,
   "position": [
    280,
    0
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "http://host.lima.internal:4319/v1/snapshot",
    "options": {
     "timeout": 10000,
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "retryOnFail": true,
   "maxTries": 2,
   "waitBetweenTries": 2000
  },
  {
   "id": "Ship to specs.remypost.me",
   "name": "Ship to specs.remypost.me",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.5,
   "position": [
    560,
    0
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://specs.remypost.me/api/v1/ingest",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "sendBody": true,
    "contentType": "json",
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
    "options": {
     "timeout": 15000
    }
   },
   "credentials": {
    "httpHeaderAuth": {
     "id": "specsIngest00001",
     "name": "specs.remypost.me ingest"
    }
   },
   "retryOnFail": true,
   "maxTries": 3,
   "waitBetweenTries": 5000
  }
 ],
